{"version":1,"key":"card:411","content":{"id":411,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"赋值的两种语义："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"拷贝语义"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"移动语义"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果实现了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Copy Trait","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，进行赋值时就是拷贝语义，会复制一份数据，如果没有实现 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Copy Trait","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，进行赋值操作是移动语义，进行赋值时会将数据的所有权转移，原先的变量不能够在使用了。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用移动语义的好处："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于大型对象，移动语义可以减少复制数据所需的时间和空间"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以在生命周期结束时自动释放内存，避免了手动管理内存"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于基本类型来说，都实现了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Copy Trait","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"整型数字"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浮点型数字"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"char","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 字符"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"bool","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"元组，前提是元组中的每个元素都实现了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Copy Trait","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"数组，前提是数组中的每个元素都实现了 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Copy Trait","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let a: i32 = 1;\nlet b = a;\n\n// 因为 i32 实现了 Copy Trait，所以仅仅是将 a 的数据复制了，\n// a 仍然保留对元数据的所有权，仍然可以使用\nprintln!(\"{}, {}\", a, b);","language":"rs","uuid":"b1b6a461-9a2c-42ed-936b-0c15d7937af7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let a = [10; 3];\nlet b = a;\n\nprintln!(\"a: {:?}\\nb: {:?}\", a, b);","language":"rs","uuid":"4a94a862-3670-44f7-b630-60e75768de3a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于引用而言没有所有权的概念，它只是对值的借用，因此对引用进行赋值不牵涉到所有权的转移"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"fn main() {\n    let s = String::from(\"hello\");\n    let s1 = &s;\n    let s2 = s1; // s1 是引用，不存在所有权的概念，复制后 s1 仍然可访问\n\n    println!(\"{}\", s1); // hello\n    println!(\"{}\", s2); // hello\n}","language":"rs","uuid":"4d174a56-7453-4fe7-94e9-5b0d7ddb4e68","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Rust/所有权"],"createTime":1709220126028,"updateTime":1755514059027,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755514059027}}